  "ingredients": [
    "6 eggs, separated",
    "0.25 teaspoon cream of tartar",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "8 tablespoons water",
    "0.25 teaspoon pandan paste",
    "5 tablespoons corn oil",
    "1 cup self-rising flour, sifted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bDgA-9hPvpli1ECqH6iSdXDUS-U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/266245-pandan-chiffon-cake-recipe-VAT-Step-01-00ca56aa6a294830bef927f834277911.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/266245/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg whites and cream of tartar in the bowl of a stand mixer fitted with the whisk attachment until stiff peaks form; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JrrlbJvdq6FU9iU-5XxFzhusoQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/266245-pandan-chiffon-cake-recipe-VAT-Step-02-dcf8fb7e6d524d55be38a68df3f922b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/266245/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg yolks and sugar together in a separate bowl until sugar dissolves.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/51partG0U1omrOgshC-0XyDeHoo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/266245-pandan-chiffon-cake-recipe-VAT-Step-03-7f5378e0bb5143f38de5e164ef30c0dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/266245/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk water and pandan paste together in a separate bowl until smooth; stir into egg yolk mixture. Stir in oil; fold in flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wdT4ftF4U4AyinEY-9zBbZzzK74=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/266245-pandan-chiffon-cake-recipe-VAT-Step-04-640ea11ca52d4233a847dbc9d4b84f24.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/266245/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently fold egg yolk-pandan mixture into egg whites with a spatula; pour into a 9-inch chiffon cake mold.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U92GyEz_mMHejozQ1aLFnCCEbQg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/266245-pandan-chiffon-cake-recipe-VAT-Step-05-d6a3a7bf159e46179a576700c1d732a7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/266245/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into center comes out clean, 45 to 50 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RE-qoxXd_f2ahZDVQlUEutI51Qw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/266245-pandan-chiffon-cake-recipe-VAT-Step-06-cfa20c68ab1e409d87298d29a03e627c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/266245/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool cake in the pan, inverted onto a wire rack. Run a sharp knife around edges to loosen cooled cake from the mold, invert carefully onto a serving plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O84PsjuluM8DwKJJM_S2i_NUoV0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/266245-pandan-chiffon-cake-recipe-VAT-Step-07-da374b890a21490497a587bada69fdfc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/266245/step_07.webp"
    }
